-    "## 8. Infrastructure-year sector mix\n",
+    "| Indicator | Raised when |\n",
+    "| --- | --- |\n",
+    "| `review_active_zero_progress` | `status_group` is `ACTIVE`, the source status is **not** `For Procurement`, and `zero_progress_flag` is true |\n",
