-    "**Reading the result:** a high project count, a high budget, or a high long-running rate describes workload. It does not show office quality or performance.\n",
+    "**Grain:** one row per integration link, link outcome, and region key. Region key `0` is included, so every current project appears **once in each link**. Never add rows across links. Adding the province links adds rows for new links only, so the grain is unchanged.\n",
